<title>GERMANY: Breuer - to join Veba, Lufthansa supervisory boards.</title>
<headline>Breuer - to join Veba, Lufthansa supervisory boards.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Future Deutsche Bank AG chief Rolf Breuer said he plans to take over outgoing chief Hilmar Kopper's seats on the supervisory boards of Veba AG and Deutsche Lufthansa AG.</p>
<p>Speaking to Reuters after delivering an address to a banking audience in Frankfurt on Wednesday evening, Breuer also said he wished to withdraw from the supervisory boards of shoe company Salamander AG and plant manufacturer Duerr AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
